cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact (code or data), please cite the paper below."
title: "Creativity Evaluation with Human vs. LLM Judges: code and data artifact"
abstract: >-
  Code and data artifact for the paper "A Framework for Evaluating
  AI-Generated Creativity: Human-LLM Agreement in Evaluating AI-Generated
  Stories". Contains the 80-story corpus, the human rating data (115 Prolific
  raters), the raw outputs of all 25 LLM judge conditions, and the generation,
  rating, and analysis scripts.
